    "updated_at": "2023-11-06T03:20:32Z",
    "body": "At the very least, since this issue originally pertained to eslint/no-invalid-regexp, I've created a separate issue for the regular expression parser. \r\nI would like to conduct discussions related to the parser here. \r\nHow do you feel about that proposal?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/web-infra-dev/oxc/issues/1164",
