    "body": "I agree. Upon closer inspection (as in remembering what I did then) the branch can't be directly integrated to oxc since it also overwrites a linter rule for testing, making it unusable for now. Also the code structure isn't great as it was created hastily without preplanning and doesn't use existing oxc infra. That means we are probably better off starting from scratch, just reusing the parsing logic, which is imo ok.",
